                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/2909: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Japan</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-08-02T17:00:00+09:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 2,
                                1920—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received August 2—9:20
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>389. Your 282, July 23, 5 p.m. Corrections having arrived I have to-day presented
                    proclamation to Foreign Office and asked for an early reply.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
